{"id":"vod_zy360_66045","vodId":"66045","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"Rewrite","name_cn":"Rewrite","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241018-1/acf0f07e509d2144c6a083e88c29f0b4.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“风祭”的都市之中，天王寺瑚太朗（森田成一配音）是一名平凡的高中生，过着风平浪静的生活。一年一度的收获祭即将到来，这个热闹欢快的祭典让整个城市都陷入了欢乐而躁动的海洋之中。瑚太郎接受了一份寻找新闻线索的工作，于是开始了在城市各处的奔走，在此过程中，只存在于都市传说之中的怪奇事件和神秘生物渐渐浮出了水面，与此同时，瑚太郎的身边亦发生了许多令他百思不得其解的怪事。为此，瑚太郎找到了超自然研究会的会长千里朱音（喜多村英梨配音），希望后者能够解答他的疑惑，哪知道在两人调查的过程中，瑚太郎的一干好友纷纷被卷入了风暴之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-18 14:08:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/UBxWBu0Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/IxySgI1J/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/3MttMCee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/bjNaUBUr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/hwIv4BgE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/nU9f36tj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/sOAcYEwm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/nDKFQeLh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/kjWJrClv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/aBYTBZZo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/sHj8bNgU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/j1YGhUam/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/LoJ4QbiZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/nHdS9UaI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/dsaRd8i0/index.m3u8"},{"nam